XSB, Inc.’s knowledge graphs – such as the SWISS Knowledge Graph – are designed to be accessed through XSB’s proprietary API rather than a public SPARQL endpoint. In other words, if you do not have the ontology or direct Prolog access, you would use their API to query the graph. XSB explicitly mentions that the SWISS Knowledge Graph “can be queried from other applications via the SWISS API.”
