.

Key points regarding access:

    SWISS API: XSB provides the SWISS API for integration. It allows enterprise applications (e.g. PLM systems like Siemens Teamcenter or PTC Windchill, MS Office, etc.) to retrieve data from the SWISS Knowledge Graph
